# auth-migrate-token: token stored in hosts.yml triggers a warning on auth status.
#
# Pre-migration shape: hosts.yml contains oauth_token inline (pre-keyring
# state). auth status should succeed (reads the token from the config file)
# and emit a warning directing the user to run `auth migrate`.
#
# This pins the observable contract from internal/config/config.go Load():
# see test/script/testdata/upgrade/auth-migrate-token.txtar (MIGRATION comment).

bb-fake server

# auth status must succeed when the token lives in hosts.yml.
bitbottle auth status -k
stdout 'Logged in as testuser'

# The warning is emitted by config.Load() whenever oauth_token is present.
stderr '! warning: token found in hosts.yml'
